 "notes": "Y-up right-handed: x=east(src x), y=up(src z), z=-north(-src y); origin at trunk base centre. Pre-segmented single tree, no ground points; ~560 isolated noise points removed. Downsampled by voxel grid (1 random point per voxel; hi 11.2 cm, lo 21.9 cm), order shuffled so any prefix is a uniform subsample. Main stem forks into several reiterated stems at ~22-24 m; trunk[] follows the main leader to ~44 m. Lower trunk (1-22 m) is wrapped in epicormic sprout foliage. Top above ~50 m is sparsely sampled (occlusion). Colours are true RGB from the scanner camera, dark overall (median ~16-18), brown bark and green foliage; brighter toward the sky-lit top. s byte = uniform random 0-255."
